composer: Traditional English
source: English carol printed in 1823 and 1833; melody as commonly sung today; verse 1 and the refrain; arranged for Sixstring Academy
arranger: Sixstring Academy
licence: Public domain (traditional); this arrangement is original to Sixstring Academy
difficulty: 4
tags: melody, chords, carol, christmas, waltz time, repeated phrases, lyrics
